                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='13647' id='13' type-v2='text' w='88267' x='533' y='5764'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Findings:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>1. In BD, Joker deal% is less appealing compared to the platform level</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>2. In HK, for vendors who is on Joker, they have roughly similar deal % for the non-joker orders</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e78bb3' fontsize='10'>Nest Step:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e78bb3' fontsize='10'>1. check the AFV and Joker voucher utilization by tiers</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e78bb3' fontsize='10'>2. differentiate between vouchers and discounts as they appear at the different stage of order funnel</run>
