    <dashboard name='Hourly Distribution'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/Foodora/workbooks/APJokerAnalysisSep-Nov21/HourlyDistribution?rev=' id='HourlyDistribution' path='/t/Foodora/workbooks/APJokerAnalysisSep-Nov21' revision='' site='Foodora' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='850' maxwidth='1500' minheight='850' minwidth='1500' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <datasources>
        <datasource name='Parameters' />
        <datasource caption='Custom SQL Query (pandata_curated)' name='federated.0i7vsh10cxw1jv15rzntj1jtl0x7' />
      </datasources>
      <datasource-dependencies datasource='Parameters'>
        <column caption='Metric' datatype='string' name='[Parameter 1]' param-domain-type='list' role='measure' type='nominal' value='&quot;Orders&quot;'>
          <calculation class='tableau' formula='&quot;Orders&quot;' />
          <members>
            <member value='&quot;Orders&quot;' />
            <member value='&quot;GFV&quot;' />
            <member value='&quot;AFV&quot;' />
          </members>
        </column>
      </datasource-dependencies>
      <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.0i7vsh10cxw1jv15rzntj1jtl0x7'>
        <column datatype='string' name='[global_entity_id]' role='dimension' type='nominal' />
        <column-instance column='[global_entity_id]' derivation='None' name='[none:global_entity_id:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
      </datasource-dependencies>
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98118' id='9' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98934' x='533' y='941'>
            <zone h='98118' id='3' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='88267' x='533' y='941'>
              <zone fixed-size='36' forceUpdate='true' h='5176' id='15' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='88267' x='533' y='941'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#e6e6e6' fontsize='15'>Hourly Distribution of Orders</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  <format attr='background-color' value='#d70f64' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='13647' id='16' type-v2='text' w='88267' x='533' y='6117'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Findings:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>1. For SG and TW, Joker orders are more reliant on lunch orders, whereby BD shows customers order more Joker for dinner orders.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>2. For SG/TW/HK, around ~5% of Joker orders are from pre-order. Such orders have a higher AFV compared to non pre-order.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e78bb3' fontsize='10'>Next Step: </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e78bb3' fontsize='10'>1. Find out the driver behind low order volume during dinner hours for TW.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e78bb3' fontsize='10'>2. Check if time spent to make an order could explain the distribution.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='58472' id='21' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='88267' x='533' y='19764'>
                <zone h='58472' id='14' name='non-jkr-non-deal' w='32976' x='533' y='19764'>
                  <layout-cache cell-count-w='24' minheight='679' non-cell-size-w='81' type-h='scalable' type-w='cell' />
