    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' lock-quick-filters='true' name='Incentive Parity'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/Foodora/workbooks/APJokerAnalysisSep-Nov21/IncentiveParity?rev=' id='IncentiveParity' path='/t/Foodora/workbooks/APJokerAnalysisSep-Nov21' revision='' site='Foodora' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='900' maxwidth='1300' minheight='900' minwidth='1300' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <datasources>
        <datasource name='Parameters' />
        <datasource caption='Custom SQL Query (pandata_curated)' name='federated.0i7vsh10cxw1jv15rzntj1jtl0x7' />
      </datasources>
      <datasource-dependencies datasource='Parameters'>
        <column alias='Incentive % incl pro delivery' caption='Incentive Metric' datatype='string' name='[Parameter 2]' param-domain-type='list' role='measure' type='nominal' value='&quot;incentive \% pro_delivery&quot;'>
          <calculation class='tableau' formula='&quot;incentive % pro_delivery&quot;' />
          <aliases>
            <alias key='&quot;incentive \% pro_delivery&quot;' value='Incentive % incl pro delivery' />
          </aliases>
          <members>
            <member value='&quot;incentive \%&quot;' />
            <member value='&quot;incentive $/order&quot;' />
            <member alias='Incentive % incl pro delivery' value='&quot;incentive \% pro_delivery&quot;' />
            <member value='&quot;valid order&quot;' />
          </members>
        </column>
      </datasource-dependencies>
      <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.0i7vsh10cxw1jv15rzntj1jtl0x7'>
        <column datatype='string' name='[expedition_type]' role='dimension' type='nominal' />
        <column datatype='string' name='[global_entity_id]' role='dimension' type='nominal' />
        <column-instance column='[expedition_type]' derivation='None' name='[none:expedition_type:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
        <column-instance column='[global_entity_id]' derivation='None' name='[none:global_entity_id:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
      </datasource-dependencies>
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98222' id='77' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98770' x='615' y='889'>
            <zone h='98222' id='3' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98770' x='615' y='889'>
              <zone fixed-size='33' forceUpdate='true' h='4556' id='5' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='98770' x='615' y='889'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#f5f5f5' fontsize='15'>Incentive Parity -  &lt;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#f5f5f5' fontsize='15'>[Parameters].[Parameter 2]</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#f5f5f5' fontsize='15'>&gt;</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  <format attr='background-color' value='#d70f64' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='21667' id='59' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98770' x='615' y='5445'>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='21667' id='13' type-v2='text' w='74386' x='615' y='5445'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d70f64'>Findings:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d70f64'>1. In BD and TH, Joker deal% is the least appealing among all incentive categories; for BD, pandapro looks aggressive, however the data might be skewed given the size of pandapro is too small at this stage for any meaningful conclusion. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d70f64'>2. In HK, for vendors which are on Joker, they offer better incentives through pandapro and platform voucher</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d70f64'>3. In SG, Joker seems to be competitive in terms of affordability.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d70f64'>4. In TW, Joker is no doubt the leader in terms of pricing competitiveness. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d70f64'>5. In MY, Joker seems uncompetitive, especially with the free delivery value</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true'>Notes:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true'>1. Changed - Incentive % now  a % of GMV, pro is now defined as order made by subscriber</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true'>2. added additional column which includes estimated platform-wide free delivery value (some data issues on a few days)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true'>3. Please use Incentive Metric dropdown - various toggles are available</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
